# 14. DNS Troubleshooting

DNS translates domain names into IP addresses.

Example:

```text
google.com
     ↓
DNS
     ↓
IP Address
```

### Troubleshooting Scenario

> User can access an IP address but cannot access websites by name.

### Process

```text
Check IP configuration
↓
Check default gateway
↓
Ping gateway
↓
Ping 8.8.8.8
↓
Ping google.com
↓
If IP works but domain fails
↓
Suspect DNS
↓
Run nslookup
↓
Check DNS configuration
↓
Apply authorized fix
↓
Verify
↓
Document
```

